	.string	"(t10,\002AN ELEMENT FOR CLOSED ORBIT CORRECTION CAN BE ONLY\002,\002 EITHER A HORIZONTAL MONITOR\002,/,t10,\002OR A VERTICAL MONITOR OR\002,\002 A HORIZONTAL CORRECTOR OR A VERTICAL CORRECTOR\002)"
